<!--
  INVARIANT 9, and it was owed. Every creation path carries an upper bound and abstains and
  flags past it.

  We named the sixteen-thousand-token output ceiling on the People pass and never applied the
  guard, which is the law that already covered it. A ceiling that is only discussed is not a
  ceiling: the run either refuses at a stated number or it discovers the number by failing
  against the model's own limit, and the second one loses the pass AND the record of having
  tried.
-->
    <fullName>AAO_Bounded_Path__c</fullName>
